msgstr ""

#: ../../src/threading.rst:260
msgid ""
"Callers should be prepared to deal with spurious wakeups on "
":c:func:`uv_cond_wait` and :c:func:`uv_cond_timedwait`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/threading.rst:262
msgid ""
"The timeout parameter for :c:func:`uv_cond_timedwait` is relative to the "
"time at which function is called."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/threading.rst:264
msgid ""
"On z/OS, the timeout parameter for :c:func:`uv_cond_timedwait` is "
"converted to an absolute system time at which the wait expires. If the "
"current system clock time passes the absolute time calculated before the "
"condition is signaled, an ETIMEDOUT error results. After the wait begins,"
" the wait time is not affected by changes to the system clock."
msgstr ""

